<?xml version="1.0" encoding="UTF-8"?><rss version="2.0"><channel><title>Orbis</title><description>Essays, briefs, slides, topics and durable knowledge.</description><link>https://raw.githack.com/XiaoDaoJiang/Orbis/preview-pr-30/</link><language>zh-CN</language><item><title>Agent 正在进入生命周期治理阶段：Memory、控制面与确定性执行成为新的可靠性边界</title><link>https://raw.githack.com/XiaoDaoJiang/Orbis/preview-pr-30/briefs/2026-09-05/</link><guid isPermaLink="true">https://raw.githack.com/XiaoDaoJiang/Orbis/preview-pr-30/briefs/2026-09-05/</guid><description>最近 48 小时的新信号显示，Agent 工程重点正在从“能否完成任务”转向“如何长期运行、如何受控变更、如何验证完成”：Memory 需要生命周期策略，基础设施 Agent 需要共享控制面，生产操作需要确定性执行，而 Coding Agent 的模型升级则进一步放大验证闭环的重要性。</description><pubDate>Sat, 05 Sep 2026 00:00:00 GMT</pubDate><category>agent-harness</category><category>coding-agent</category><category>mcp</category></item><item><title>Orbis Weekly — Presentation Becomes a Platform Boundary</title><link>https://raw.githack.com/XiaoDaoJiang/Orbis/preview-pr-30/briefs/2026-09-01-weekly/</link><guid isPermaLink="true">https://raw.githack.com/XiaoDaoJiang/Orbis/preview-pr-30/briefs/2026-09-01-weekly/</guid><description>A weekly judgment on how Orbis moved from a Daily-only slide path toward a reusable structured publishing and discovery platform.</description><pubDate>Tue, 01 Sep 2026 00:00:00 GMT</pubDate><category>agent-harness</category><category>coding-agent</category></item><item><title>Agent Harness 为什么成为系统竞争层</title><link>https://raw.githack.com/XiaoDaoJiang/Orbis/preview-pr-30/essays/agent-harness-system-layer/</link><guid isPermaLink="true">https://raw.githack.com/XiaoDaoJiang/Orbis/preview-pr-30/essays/agent-harness-system-layer/</guid><description>当模型逐渐商品化，状态、权限、环境和验证开始决定真实任务完成率。</description><pubDate>Fri, 28 Aug 2026 00:00:00 GMT</pubDate><category>agent-harness</category><category>coding-agent</category></item><item><title>Harness 正在成为模型之外的能力层</title><link>https://raw.githack.com/XiaoDaoJiang/Orbis/preview-pr-30/briefs/2026-08-28/</link><guid isPermaLink="true">https://raw.githack.com/XiaoDaoJiang/Orbis/preview-pr-30/briefs/2026-08-28/</guid><description>从模型调用走向状态、权限、验证与可恢复执行，Agent 系统的竞争边界正在持续外移。</description><pubDate>Fri, 28 Aug 2026 00:00:00 GMT</pubDate><category>agent-harness</category><category>coding-agent</category><category>mcp</category></item><item><title>Verification Loop</title><link>https://raw.githack.com/XiaoDaoJiang/Orbis/preview-pr-30/knowledge/verification-loop/</link><guid isPermaLink="true">https://raw.githack.com/XiaoDaoJiang/Orbis/preview-pr-30/knowledge/verification-loop/</guid><description>让 Agent 通过执行、观察、验证和修复证明任务完成的闭环模式。</description><pubDate>Fri, 28 Aug 2026 00:00:00 GMT</pubDate><category>coding-agent</category><category>agent-harness</category></item></channel></rss>